* Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2019-2026), processed in Google
  Earth Engine.
* Precipitation and temperature: MeteoSchweiz Open Data, SwissMetNet
  (CC BY 4.0). Quelle: MeteoSchweiz.
* Field geometries and land-use codes: Nutzungsflächen, Kanton St. Gallen.
  These are NOT redistributed in this repository, in any form. Everything the
  demo runs on is synthetic (see src/drought/synthetic/).
